framing record

# DKM drawing-vocabulary wave: REAL binary op frame. `SemioDrawingMutation` is a genuine
# data-carrying enum whose variants embed nested `DrawLayer`/`DrawNode`/`PathSegment` payloads —
# `DrawNode` is additionally RECURSIVE — no `dsl::DslField` impl exists for these hand-rolled
# tagged enums (per this subset's own `📸️snapshot`/`🔺️diff` convention), so the generic derive-
# based `format u8 | ordinal varint | record body` layout doesn't apply. Handcrafted instead:
# `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT` convention) + `tag u8` (the `SemioDrawingMutation` variant
# ordinal, `../💾️binary/🦀️component.rs`'s `OP_KEYWORDS`/`variant_ordinal`, 0-16 matching
# `parse_drawing_mutation`'s keyword match) as two REAL fixed fields, then the variant's own
# `tag:args` argument payload as one opaque trailing `bytes` chain — the same honest boundary the
# sibling `../../🔺️diff/💾️binary/📡️component.protocol.semio` uses.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8

chain payload bytes
